      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to protect against infinite loops? Wouldn\u0027t any such loop be a bug in the kernel? Or are you trying to protect against a bug in this parsing code? Or...?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 932,
        "startChar": 66,
