      "writtenOn": "2023-01-16T15:37:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is incorrect if nlmsgLen is not aligned on a 4-byte boundary. nlmsgLen is the length of the message header plus payload, but the message is padded, such that the next message, if any, is aligned on a 4-byte boundery. Just use NetlinkMessage.parse, that will take care of that for you.",
